    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like word search games? In Word Mesh, you have to find more than 3000 words in 10 languages ( 27000 Words if you play all ;) ). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite category out of 8 or mix them all together for the ultimative word find challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two difficulty levels and five field sizes will help you adjust the game to your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With random generated playfields, you never will get the same word combinations - endless fun! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Categories:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- animals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- art, music and film</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- to eat and drink</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- geography</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- history and people</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- miscellaneous</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- nature</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- sport and health</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 difficulty levels (normal mode -&gt; reverse words included, easy -&gt; no reverse words)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Word Mesh sizes: 20x20 15x15 12x12 10x10 8x8 6x6 letters playfield</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- automatic generated levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 8 categories + random and mix all </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- more than 3000 words in 10 languages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Languages:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Czech, German, English, Spanish, French, Italian, Norwegian, Russian, Polish, Swedish</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like word search games? In Word Mesh, you have to find more than 3000 words in 10 languages ( 27000 Words if you play all ;) ). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite category out of 8 or mix them all together for the ultimative word find challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two difficulty levels and five field sizes will help you adjust the game to your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With random generated playfields, you never will get the same word combinations - endless fun! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Categories:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- animals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- art, music and film</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- to eat and drink</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- geography</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- history and people</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- miscellaneous</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- nature</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- sport and health</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 difficulty levels (normal mode -&gt; reverse words included, easy -&gt; no reverse words)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Word Mesh sizes: 20x20 15x15 12x12 10x10 8x8 6x6 letters playfield</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- automatic generated levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 8 categories + random and mix all </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- more than 3000 words in 10 languages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Languages:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Czech, German, English, Spanish, French, Italian, Norwegian, Russian, Polish, Swedish</p>",
